#: doc/kdesrc-build.desktop:5
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "KDE Source Builder"
msgstr "Compilador do código de KDE"

#: doc/kdesrc-build.desktop:47
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"Builds the KDE Platform and associated software from its source code. A "
"command-line only program."
msgstr ""
"Compila a plataforma KDE e o software asociado a partires do código fonte. "
"Programa de só liña de ordes."
